---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
const root = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/$/, '');
const gameUrl = root + '/games/admin-skills-exam.html';
---
<BaseLayout title="行政技能小考試｜報到第一天" description="進入馬鞍社區協會，透過出納、人事與計畫專員的工作情境，練習行政實務。遊戲製作者：石竣旻。">
  <section class="exam-intro">
    <div class="wrap">
      <p class="breadcrumbs"><a href={root + '/knowledge/tools/'}>工作工具與技能</a> / 行政技能小考試</p>
      <span class="eyebrow">INTERACTIVE SKILLS QUIZ</span>
      <h1 class="page-title">行政技能小考試：報到第一天</h1>
      <p class="exam-description">來到馬鞍社區協會上班，扮演出納、人事主任與計畫專員。從文件、付款和真實感的工作情境中，練習所得分類、補充保費與行政判斷；完成三個角色後，挑戰終章。</p>
      <p class="exam-credit"><strong>遊戲製作者：石竣旻</strong> <span aria-hidden="true">｜</span> 題目依 2026 年（民國 115 年）制度設計</p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="exam-content" aria-label="行政技能互動考試">
    <div class="wrap exam-toolbar">
      <p>可用電腦鍵盤或手機點擊操作；答題進度儲存於目前瀏覽器。</p>
      <a href={gameUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="exam-expand">另開全螢幕遊戲 ↗</a>
    </div>
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="exam-frame">
        <iframe src={gameUrl} title="報到第一天：馬鞍社區協會行政技能小考試，製作者石竣旻" loading="eager" allow="fullscreen" allowfullscreen></iframe>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="wrap exam-below">
      <p>本遊戲為行政實務學習用途。付款、所得分類與健保費用的實際辦理仍以主管機關當年公告及個案規定為準。</p>
      <a class="text-link" href={root + '/entries/supplemental-premium/'}>延伸閱讀：二代健保補充保費 ↗</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
<style>
  .exam-intro{padding:46px 0 34px;background:#f4f3ec}
  .exam-intro .page-title{font-size:clamp(30px,4vw,45px);margin:12px 0}
  .exam-description{max-width:860px;color:#526b5b;font-size:16px;line-height:1.9}
  .exam-credit{margin:14px 0 0;color:#76583b;font-size:14px}
  .exam-credit strong{color:#3a543f}
  .exam-content{padding:24px 0 65px}
  .exam-toolbar{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:15px;margin-bottom:14px}
  .exam-toolbar p,.exam-below p{font-size:13px;line-height:1.8;color:#637568;margin:0}
  .exam-expand{font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:#294936;border:1px solid #b9cdbd;border-radius:5px;padding:10px 14px;flex-shrink:0}
  .exam-expand:hover{background:#eaf0e9}
  .exam-frame{height:min(78vh,820px);min-height:530px;border:1px solid #d8dfd5;border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden;background:#140e09}
  .exam-frame iframe{display:block;width:100%;height:100%;border:0}
  .exam-below{padding-top:16px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px;align-items:start}
  @media(max-width:740px){.exam-intro{padding:30px 0 25px}.exam-description{font-size:15px}.exam-toolbar,.exam-below{align-items:stretch;flex-direction:column}.exam-expand{text-align:center}.exam-frame{height:75svh;min-height:490px}.exam-content{padding-top:16px}}
</style>
